    "Follow-up questions need Apple Intelligence. Turn it on in Settings › Apple Intelligence & Siri on a supported iPhone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تحتاج أسئلة المتابعة إلى Apple Intelligence. فعّلها من الإعدادات › Apple Intelligence وSiri على iPhone مدعوم."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folgefragen benötigen Apple Intelligence. Aktiviere sie unter Einstellungen › Apple Intelligence & Siri auf einem unterstützten iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las preguntas de seguimiento requieren Apple Intelligence. Actívalo en Ajustes › Apple Intelligence y Siri en un iPhone compatible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les questions de suivi nécessitent Apple Intelligence. Activez-la dans Réglages › Apple Intelligence et Siri sur un iPhone compatible."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "שאלות המשך דורשות Apple Intelligence. אפשר להפעיל אותה ב״הגדרות״ › ״Apple Intelligence ו-Siri״ ב-iPhone נתמך."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आगे के सवालों के लिए Apple Intelligence ज़रूरी है। किसी समर्थित iPhone पर सेटिंग्स › Apple Intelligence और Siri में इसे चालू करें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pertanyaan lanjutan memerlukan Apple Intelligence. Nyalakan di Pengaturan › Apple Intelligence & Siri pada iPhone yang didukung."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le domande di approfondimento richiedono Apple Intelligence. Attivala in Impostazioni › Apple Intelligence e Siri su un iPhone supportato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "追加の質問にはApple Intelligenceが必要です。対応するiPhoneで「設定」›「Apple IntelligenceとSiri」からオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "추가 질문에는 Apple Intelligence가 필요합니다. 지원되는 iPhone의 설정 › Apple Intelligence 및 Siri에서 켜세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voor vervolgvragen is Apple Intelligence nodig. Schakel het in via Instellingen › Apple Intelligence en Siri op een ondersteunde iPhone."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pytania uzupełniające wymagają Apple Intelligence. Włącz ją w Ustawieniach › Apple Intelligence i Siri na obsługiwanym iPhonie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As perguntas de acompanhamento exigem a Apple Intelligence. Ative-a em Ajustes › Apple Intelligence e Siri em um iPhone compatível."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для уточняющих вопросов нужна Apple Intelligence. Включите её в «Настройки» › «Apple Intelligence и Siri» на поддерживаемом iPhone."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คำถามต่อเนื่องต้องใช้ Apple Intelligence เปิดใช้ได้ที่ การตั้งค่า › Apple Intelligence และ Siri บน iPhone ที่รองรับ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Takip soruları için Apple Intelligence gerekir. Desteklenen bir iPhone’da Ayarlar › Apple Intelligence ve Siri’den açın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
